{'symbol': 'MHK', 'date': '2019-11-24 22:30:00', 'title': 'BEASLEY FLOORING PRODUCTS, INC. ENTERED INTO A LETTER OF INTENT TO ACQUIRE FLOORING MANUFACTURING OPERATIONS FROM MOHAWK INDUSTRIES, INC. (NYSE:MHK).', 'text': 'BEASLEY FLOORING PRODUCTS, INC. ENTERED INTO A LETTER OF INTENT TO ACQUIRE FLOORING MANUFACTURING OPERATIONS FROM MOHAWK INDUSTRIES, INC. (NYSE:MHK) ON NOVEMBER 25, 2019. PURSUANT TO THE TRANSACTION, BEASLEY FLOORING WILL PURCHASE THE MELBOURNE, ARKANSAS FLOORING MANUFACTURING OPERATIONS OF MOHAWK INDUSTRIES. TRANSACTION IS SUBJECT TO CUSTOMARY TERMS AND CONDITIONS.\n'}